          "text": "CH'IEN I-chi 錢儀吉 (T. 藹人, 星湖, H. 衎石, original ming 逵吉), 1783–1850, May 18, scholar, native of Chia-hsing, Chekiang, was a great-grandson of Ch'ien Ch'ên-ch'ün [q. v.]. His grandfather, Ch'ien Ju-kung 錢汝恭 (T. 雨時, H. 蔇齋, Jan.",
